{
  "doc": [
    "cpp/patch_core/stored_items.h MigrateStoredItems, and the hosts that apply its plan.",
    "layout: the legacy layout (android 1, ios 2, harmony 3; a number is passed as is).",
    "legacy values are typed as the legacy store held them: a boolean reads as \"1\"/\"0\",",
    "a number as its text, anything else (a dictionary, an array) as \"\" (a key to delete,",
    "never a value to carry). plan null: no plan (unknown layout). after: both stores once",
    "the puts and then the removes are applied; re-planning there is a no-op."
